{
  "overview": "<section class=\"nh-briefing\" aria-labelledby=\"nh-title\">\n  <div class=\"nh-briefing-top\">\n    <div class=\"nh-title-block\">\n      <h1 id=\"nh-title\">Network operations</h1>\n      <p>Switch, port, and fleet evidence in one place.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div id=\"oh-freshness\" class=\"overview-freshness\" role=\"status\">Checking source freshness…</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"nh-briefing-grid\">\n    <section class=\"nh-priority\" aria-labelledby=\"oh-attention-title\">\n      <div class=\"nh-panel-heading\">\n        <h2 id=\"oh-attention-title\">Needs attention</h2>\n        <span>Finding scan</span>\n      </div>\n      <div id=\"oh-attention\"><div class=\"nskel\" style=\"height:220px\"></div></div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"nh-site-panel\" aria-labelledby=\"oh-sites-title\">\n      <div class=\"nh-panel-heading\">\n        <h2 id=\"oh-sites-title\">Sites</h2>\n        <span id=\"oh-siteN\">—</span>\n      </div>\n      <div id=\"oh-sites\"><div class=\"nskel\" style=\"height:220px\"></div></div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"nh-fleet\" aria-labelledby=\"nh-fleet-title\">\n  <div class=\"nh-section-heading\">\n    <div><h2 id=\"nh-fleet-title\">Fleet health</h2><p>Switch counts follow the selected site. Wireless remains fleet-wide.</p></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"ngrid\" id=\"oh-kpis\">\n    <div class=\"c3\"><div class=\"nkpi\"><span class=\"k\">Loading fleet health</span><span class=\"v\">—</span></div></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"nh-systems\" aria-labelledby=\"nh-systems-title\">\n  <div class=\"nh-section-heading\"><div><h2 id=\"nh-systems-title\">Systems</h2><p>Firewall and wireless readings are separate feeds from switch findings.</p></div></div>\n  <div class=\"ngrid overview-systems\">\n    <section class=\"ncard c6\" aria-labelledby=\"oh-fw-title\">\n      <div class=\"nch\"><h2 id=\"oh-fw-title\">Firewalls</h2><button class=\"nbtn\" type=\"button\" data-ops-traffic>Investigate traffic</button></div>\n      <div class=\"ncb\" id=\"oh-fw\"><div class=\"nskel\" style=\"height:120px\"></div></div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"ncard c6\" aria-labelledby=\"oh-wifi-title\">\n      <div class=\"nch\"><h2 id=\"oh-wifi-title\">Wireless</h2><a class=\"nbtn\" href=\"/network-observatory.html\">Live building</a></div>\n      <div class=\"ncb\" id=\"oh-wifi\"><div class=\"nskel\" style=\"height:120px\"></div></div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"ngrid overview-supporting\">\n    <section class=\"ncard c8 overview-trend-card\" aria-labelledby=\"oh-trend-title\">\n      <div class=\"nch\"><h2 id=\"oh-trend-title\">Ports developing errors</h2><div class=\"nseg\" id=\"oh-tRange\"></div></div>\n      <div class=\"ncb\"><div id=\"oh-trend\"><div class=\"nskel\" style=\"height:118px\"></div></div></div>\n      <div class=\"ncf\" id=\"oh-tFoot\"></div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"ncard c4\" id=\"oh-watch-card\" aria-labelledby=\"oh-watch-title\">\n      <div class=\"nch\"><h2 id=\"oh-watch-title\">Watch list</h2><span class=\"sev\" id=\"oh-watchN\">—</span></div>\n      <div class=\"ncb\" id=\"oh-watch\"><div class=\"nskel\" style=\"height:80px\"></div></div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<details class=\"ncard overview-findings\" id=\"oh-findings\">\n  <summary class=\"nch overview-findings-summary\"><span><h2 id=\"oh-fqIcon\">Port findings</h2><small id=\"oh-findings-summary-copy\">Open the full findings list</small></span><b id=\"oh-findings-toggle\">Review findings</b></summary>\n  <div class=\"overview-findings-body\">\n    <div class=\"overview-findings-controls\"><div class=\"nseg\" id=\"oh-fFilter\"></div><button class=\"nbtn\" id=\"oh-fExport\" type=\"button\" title=\"Download the current view as CSV\">CSV</button></div>\n    <div class=\"op-tools overview-findings-search\"><input type=\"search\" class=\"op-input\" id=\"oh-faultSearch\" aria-label=\"Search port findings\" placeholder=\"Search switch, IP, port, finding or description…\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"op-btn\" id=\"oh-faultReset\">Reset filters</button></div>\n    <div class=\"ncb flush\"><div class=\"ntw\" id=\"oh-faults\"></div></div>\n    <div class=\"ncf\" id=\"oh-fFoot\"></div>\n  </div>\n</details>\n",
  "switches": "\n  <div class=\"ngrid\" id=\"os-kpis\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"ngrid\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">\n    <section class=\"ncard c12\" id=\"os-panelCard\">\n      <div class=\"nch\">\n        <h2 id=\"os-panelTitle\">Front panel</h2>\n        <div class=\"tools\" id=\"os-panelTools\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"panelwrap\" id=\"os-panel\">\n        <div class=\"nskel\" style=\"height:120px;border-radius:12px\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"ngrid\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">\n    <section class=\"ncard c8\">\n      <div class=\"nch\"><h2>Inventory</h2>\n        <div class=\"tools\">\n          <div class=\"nseg\" id=\"os-siteSeg\"></div>\n          <div class=\"nsearch\" style=\"flex:0 0 190px\">\n            <input id=\"os-q\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Filter name, model, IP…\" aria-label=\"Filter switches\">\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"op-tools\" style=\"padding:0 var(--n-pad)\"><select class=\"op-input\" id=\"os-switchCondition\" aria-label=\"Switch condition\"><option value=\"all\">All conditions</option><option value=\"offline\">Not responding</option><option value=\"offstd\">Off standard build</option><option value=\"core\">Core / distribution</option></select><button class=\"op-btn\" type=\"button\" id=\"os-switchReset\">Reset filters</button><button class=\"op-btn\" type=\"button\" id=\"os-switchExport\">Export CSV</button></div><div class=\"ncb flush\"><div class=\"ntw cap\" id=\"os-rows\"></div></div>\n      <div class=\"ncf\" id=\"os-foot\"></div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"ncard c4\">\n      <div class=\"nch\"><h2>Selected switch</h2></div>\n      <div class=\"ncb\" id=\"os-detail\"></div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n",
  "investigate": "<span id=\"ot-tchip\" hidden></span>  <div class=\"ngrid\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">\n    <div class=\"c9\"><div class=\"op-tools op-trace-tools\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"op-btn\" id=\"ot-traceClear\">Clear trace</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"op-btn\" id=\"ot-traceCopy\">Copy trace link</button><span id=\"ot-traceMessage\" class=\"op-results\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><div id=\"ot-out\"></div></div>\n    <div class=\"c3\" style=\"display:grid;gap:10px;align-content:start\">\n      <section class=\"ncard\">\n        <div class=\"nch\"><h2>Recent</h2><div class=\"tools\"><span class=\"sev\" id=\"ot-recN\">&mdash;</span></div></div>\n        <div class=\"ncb flush\"><div class=\"nlist\" id=\"ot-qList\" aria-label=\"Recent traces\"></div></div>\n      </section>\n      <section class=\"ncard\">\n        <div class=\"nch\"><h2>What this reads</h2></div>\n        <div class=\"ncb\" style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--o-dim);line-height:1.55\">\n          One lookup joins the <b>firewall</b> path out, the <b>switch port</b> it plugs into,\n          its <b>Wi-Fi</b> access point and the <b>identity</b> that owns it &mdash; so you can\n          tell in seconds whether a device is on, where it connects, and what is wrong.\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n",
  "traffic": "\n  <div class=\"traffic-intro ncard\">\n    <div class=\"nch\"><h2 id=\"tr-heading\">On-prem traffic at Irvine</h2><span class=\"sev info\" id=\"tr-source-status\">Reading sources…</span></div>\n    <div class=\"ncb\"><p>Review traffic from on-prem office networks, rewind an earlier peak, then inspect local people, sites, and paths. WAN meters show the physical office link.</p>\n      <div class=\"traffic-controls\"><label>Window <select class=\"op-input\" id=\"tr-window\"><option value=\"focus\" disabled>Focused window</option><option value=\"today\">Today</option><option value=\"24h\">Last 24 hours</option><option value=\"7d\">Last 7 days</option></select></label>\n      <button class=\"nbtn\" id=\"tr-refresh\" type=\"button\">Refresh evidence</button><button class=\"nbtn\" id=\"tr-reset\" type=\"button\" hidden>Clear focus</button><span id=\"tr-window-note\"></span></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <nav class=\"traffic-quick-nav\" aria-label=\"Traffic investigation sections\"><button type=\"button\" data-tr-section=\"tr-critical-card\">Critical apps</button><button type=\"button\" data-tr-section=\"tr-access-card\">Access rates</button><button type=\"button\" data-tr-section=\"tr-timeline\">Peak timeline</button><button type=\"button\" data-tr-section=\"tr-users-card\">Users and sites</button><button type=\"button\" data-tr-section=\"tr-search-card\">Find a path</button><button type=\"button\" data-tr-section=\"tr-stream-card\">Applications</button><button type=\"button\" data-tr-section=\"tr-dest-card\">Network layers</button></nav>\n  <div class=\"traffic-section-head\"><div><span class=\"traffic-section-kicker\">Now</span><h2>Live WAN and observed users</h2></div><p>Physical WAN rates are live. User averages use partial proxy logs filtered to office DHCP addresses.</p></div>\n  <div class=\"ngrid traffic-gauges\">\n    <section class=\"ncard c4\"><div class=\"nch\"><h2>WAN download</h2><span class=\"sev info\">FortiGate counter</span></div><div class=\"ncb\"><button class=\"traffic-gauge\" type=\"button\" data-tr-jump=\"timeline\" id=\"tr-down-gauge\" aria-label=\"Inspect WAN download trend\"><span class=\"traffic-dial\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 300 155\" focusable=\"false\"><path class=\"traffic-gauge-track\" d=\"M45 130 A105 105 0 0 1 255 130\"/><path class=\"traffic-gauge-zone normal\" d=\"M45 130 A105 105 0 0 1 211.7 45.1\"/><path class=\"traffic-gauge-zone warn\" d=\"M211.7 45.1 A105 105 0 0 1 249.9 97.6\"/><path class=\"traffic-gauge-zone hot\" d=\"M249.9 97.6 A105 105 0 0 1 255 130\"/><path class=\"traffic-gauge-tick\" d=\"M50 130h8 M79.3 59.3l5.7 5.7 M150 30v8 M220.7 59.3l-5.7 5.7 M250 130h-8\"/><g class=\"traffic-gauge-scale\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><text x=\"29\" y=\"149\" data-tr-tick=\"0\">0</text><text x=\"60\" y=\"44\" data-tr-tick=\"25\">—</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"17\" data-tr-tick=\"50\">—</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"44\" data-tr-tick=\"75\">—</text><text x=\"270\" y=\"149\" data-tr-tick=\"100\">—</text></g><line class=\"traffic-needle\" x1=\"150\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"48\"/><circle class=\"traffic-needle-hub\" cx=\"150\" cy=\"130\" r=\"7\"/></svg></span><strong id=\"tr-down\">—</strong><span class=\"traffic-gauge-unit\">Mbps</span><span class=\"traffic-gauge-status\" id=\"tr-down-status\">Sampling live rate</span></button><p id=\"tr-down-meta\">Waiting for two samples</p></div></section>\n    <section class=\"ncard c4\"><div class=\"nch\"><h2>WAN upload</h2><span class=\"sev info\">FortiGate counter</span></div><div class=\"ncb\"><button class=\"traffic-gauge\" type=\"button\" data-tr-jump=\"timeline\" id=\"tr-up-gauge\" aria-label=\"Inspect WAN upload trend\"><span class=\"traffic-dial\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 300 155\" focusable=\"false\"><path class=\"traffic-gauge-track\" d=\"M45 130 A105 105 0 0 1 255 130\"/><path class=\"traffic-gauge-zone normal\" d=\"M45 130 A105 105 0 0 1 211.7 45.1\"/><path class=\"traffic-gauge-zone warn\" d=\"M211.7 45.1 A105 105 0 0 1 249.9 97.6\"/><path class=\"traffic-gauge-zone hot\" d=\"M249.9 97.6 A105 105 0 0 1 255 130\"/><path class=\"traffic-gauge-tick\" d=\"M50 130h8 M79.3 59.3l5.7 5.7 M150 30v8 M220.7 59.3l-5.7 5.7 M250 130h-8\"/><g class=\"traffic-gauge-scale\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><text x=\"29\" y=\"149\" data-tr-tick=\"0\">0</text><text x=\"60\" y=\"44\" data-tr-tick=\"25\">—</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"17\" data-tr-tick=\"50\">—</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"44\" data-tr-tick=\"75\">—</text><text x=\"270\" y=\"149\" data-tr-tick=\"100\">—</text></g><line class=\"traffic-needle\" x1=\"150\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"48\"/><circle class=\"traffic-needle-hub\" cx=\"150\" cy=\"130\" r=\"7\"/></svg></span><strong id=\"tr-up\">—</strong><span class=\"traffic-gauge-unit\">Mbps</span><span class=\"traffic-gauge-status\" id=\"tr-up-status\">Sampling live rate</span></button><p id=\"tr-up-meta\">Waiting for two samples</p></div></section>\n    <section class=\"ncard c4 traffic-top-users-card\"><div class=\"nch\"><h2>Top 5 office users</h2><span class=\"sev warn\">Office proxy</span></div><div class=\"ncb\"><p class=\"traffic-user-rate-label\">Average observed download in selected window <strong>Mbps</strong></p><p class=\"traffic-user-refresh\" id=\"tr-user-refreshed\" aria-live=\"polite\">Checking observed users…</p><div id=\"tr-capacity-users\" aria-live=\"polite\"><div class=\"nempty\">Loading observed user rates…</div></div><p class=\"traffic-user-rate-note\" id=\"tr-capacity-scope\">Office DHCP source IPs in partial Zscaler web logs; these are not total WAN user speeds.</p></div></section>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"traffic-gauge-key\"><b>Gauge bands:</b> <span class=\"normal\">Under 70%</span><span class=\"warn\">70–89%</span><span class=\"hot\">90% and above</span><small id=\"tr-meter-time\">Sampling WAN counter…</small></p>\n  <section class=\"ncard traffic-critical-card\" id=\"tr-critical-card\"><div class=\"nch\"><h2>Business-critical apps</h2><span class=\"sev info\">Selected window</span></div><div class=\"ncb\"><p class=\"traffic-note\">Zoom, Teams, Riverside, live-video.net, and Vonage are pinned for a focused site check. Signals come from local APs or office-source proxy logs; they do not prove a live call. live-video.net is Amazon IVS, a live-video CDN shared by Riverside, Twitch and others.</p><p class=\"traffic-note traffic-pin-status\" id=\"tr-pin-status\" role=\"status\">Users active in the last 30 min · checking now</p><div id=\"tr-critical-apps\" class=\"traffic-critical-grid\"></div></div></section>\n  <section class=\"ncard traffic-access-card\" id=\"tr-access-card\"><div class=\"nch\"><h2>Access rates</h2><span class=\"sev info\">Recent samples</span></div><div class=\"ncb\"><div class=\"traffic-access-grid\"><div><h3>Top switch ports</h3><p class=\"traffic-note\">Paired SNMP counters show traffic entering and leaving each port. Port direction varies by connection; shared ports are not individual users.</p><div id=\"tr-access-switches\"></div></div><div><h3>Top Wi-Fi clients on APs</h3><p class=\"traffic-note\">Approximate 5-minute download and upload averages for clients on local Meraki APs. Recent AP and identity are reported labels.</p><div id=\"tr-access-wifi\"></div></div></div><p class=\"traffic-access-time\" id=\"tr-access-time\">Checking recent access usage…</p></div></section>\n  <div class=\"traffic-section-head\"><div><span class=\"traffic-section-kicker\">Rewind</span><h2>Find the peak</h2></div><p>Select a bucket to focus the same two-hour window across the evidence below.</p></div>\n  <section class=\"ncard traffic-timeline\" id=\"tr-timeline\"><div class=\"nch\"><h2>FortiGate logged traffic</h2><span class=\"sev info\" id=\"tr-graph-grain\">Loading…</span></div><div class=\"ncb\"><p class=\"traffic-note\" id=\"tr-chart-note\">Download and upload bytes are plotted per log bucket. Click a bucket to inspect its surrounding two hours and update the user, site, and firewall rankings. WAN speedometers stay live.</p><div id=\"tr-chart\" class=\"traffic-chart\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"FortiGate traffic timeline\"></div><div id=\"tr-chart-detail\" class=\"traffic-chart-detail\"></div></div></section>\n  <div class=\"traffic-section-head\"><div><span class=\"traffic-section-kicker\">Selected window</span><h2>What stands out</h2></div><p>Firewall, proxy, and Wi-Fi values have different scopes.</p></div>\n  <div class=\"ngrid traffic-summary\">\n    <section class=\"ncard c8\" aria-labelledby=\"tr-brief-title\"><div class=\"nch\"><h2 id=\"tr-brief-title\">Largest observed paths</h2><span class=\"sev info\">Selected window</span></div><div class=\"ncb\"><div class=\"traffic-brief-grid\"><div><span>Firewall destination</span><strong id=\"tr-brief-dest\">Loading…</strong><small id=\"tr-brief-dest-volume\">FortiView WAN egress</small></div><div><span>Proxy user</span><strong id=\"tr-brief-user\">Loading…</strong><small id=\"tr-brief-user-volume\">Partial proxy coverage</small></div><div><span>Proxy site</span><strong id=\"tr-brief-domain\">Loading…</strong><small id=\"tr-brief-domain-volume\">Partial proxy coverage</small></div></div><p id=\"tr-brief-scope\" class=\"traffic-note\"></p></div></section>\n    <section class=\"ncard c4\" aria-labelledby=\"tr-quality-title\"><div class=\"nch\"><h2 id=\"tr-quality-title\">Evidence quality</h2></div><div class=\"ncb\"><div id=\"tr-quality\" class=\"traffic-quality\" aria-live=\"polite\">Checking source freshness and scope…</div></div></section>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"ngrid traffic-priorities\">\n    <section class=\"ncard c6\" id=\"tr-users-card\"><div class=\"nch\"><h2>Top observed proxy users</h2><span class=\"sev warn\">Partial coverage</span></div><div class=\"ncb\"><p class=\"traffic-note\">Observed downloads from office DHCP source IPs in this window. This is a partial user ranking; select a user to see recorded sites.</p><div class=\"traffic-user-layout\"><div id=\"tr-users\"></div><div id=\"tr-user-sites\" aria-live=\"polite\"><div class=\"nempty\">Select a user to inspect sites.</div></div></div></div></section>\n    <section class=\"ncard c6\" id=\"tr-web-card\"><div class=\"nch\"><h2>Top observed proxy sites</h2><span class=\"sev warn\">Partial coverage</span></div><div class=\"ncb\"><p class=\"traffic-note\">Observed Zscaler web sites and exact hosts from office DHCP source IPs. Select a host to see recorded users; missing sites may still have been used.</p><form id=\"tr-domain-form\" class=\"traffic-domain-search\"><label for=\"tr-domain\">Find a site in observed proxy logs</label><div><input id=\"tr-domain\" class=\"op-input\" type=\"search\" maxlength=\"100\" placeholder=\"e.g. riverside.fm\"><select id=\"tr-domain-field\" class=\"op-input\" aria-label=\"Match type\"><option value=\"domain\">Site family</option><option value=\"host\">Exact host</option></select><button class=\"nbtn\" type=\"submit\">Find site</button></div></form><div id=\"tr-domain-results\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div id=\"tr-web\"></div></div></section>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"traffic-section-head\"><div><span class=\"traffic-section-kicker\">Investigate</span><h2>Trace a person, device, or service</h2></div><p>Use a direct path search or inspect classified applications.</p></div>\n  <section class=\"ncard traffic-search-card\" id=\"tr-search-card\"><div class=\"nch\"><h2>Find a path</h2></div><div class=\"ncb\"><form id=\"tr-search-form\" class=\"traffic-search\"><label for=\"tr-query\">User, MAC, IP, device, switch, or port</label><div><input id=\"tr-query\" class=\"op-input\" type=\"search\" maxlength=\"80\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"e.g. 10.20.40.129, a MAC, person, SNA01 switch, or Gi1/0/12\"><button class=\"nbtn\" type=\"submit\">Search</button></div></form><p class=\"traffic-note\">Local Wi-Fi clients and switch inventory are searched here. Office-source proxy matches appear for names; identity-only searches continue in Investigate.</p><div id=\"tr-search-results\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div></div></section>\n  <section class=\"ncard traffic-streaming\" id=\"tr-stream-card\"><div class=\"nch\"><h2>Application categories</h2><span class=\"sev info\" id=\"tr-stream-status\">Checking service signals…</span></div><div class=\"ncb\"><p class=\"traffic-note\">Browse streaming, meetings, webinars, social media, and other traffic. Meraki shows Wi-Fi application and destination labels; Rapid7 shows observed proxy sites and users. Tunnel labels alone cannot identify the inner service.</p>\n    <p class=\"traffic-note\">Choose a category to inspect its Wi-Fi labels and ranked proxy sites, then select a service or use the custom lookup. Counts are source rows, not a deduplicated bandwidth total; no ranked signal does not prove non-use.</p>\n    <div id=\"tr-category-groups\" class=\"traffic-category-groups\"></div>\n    <div class=\"traffic-stream-checks\"><h3>Custom site or host lookup</h3>\n      <form id=\"tr-stream-form\" class=\"traffic-stream-form\"><label for=\"tr-stream-query\">Site or exact host</label><div><input id=\"tr-stream-query\" class=\"op-input\" type=\"search\" maxlength=\"100\" placeholder=\"e.g. webex.com or tv.youtube.com\"><select id=\"tr-stream-field\" class=\"op-input\" aria-label=\"Match type\"><option value=\"domain\">Site family</option><option value=\"host\">Exact host</option></select><button class=\"nbtn\" type=\"submit\">Check users</button></div></form><div id=\"tr-stream-results\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n    </div><p class=\"traffic-note traffic-stream-limit\">A service site hit does not prove playback or a live call. YouTube and googlevideo do not identify YouTube TV; social apps do not establish video streaming. Shared media delivery may use other endpoints.</p></div></section>\n\n\n  <div class=\"traffic-section-head\"><div><span class=\"traffic-section-kicker\">Network layers</span><h2>Compare the paths</h2></div><p>Tunnel endpoints, Wi-Fi labels, and switch ports each describe a different part of the route.</p></div>\n  <div class=\"ngrid traffic-data-grid\">\n    <section class=\"ncard c6\" id=\"tr-dest-card\"><div class=\"nch\"><h2>Firewall destinations</h2><span class=\"sev info\">WAN egress</span></div><div class=\"ncb\"><p class=\"traffic-note\">The largest external destinations in the selected window. Zscaler tunnel endpoints carry many inner sites.</p><div id=\"tr-dest\"></div></div></section>\n    <section class=\"ncard c6\" id=\"tr-source-card\"><div class=\"nch\"><h2>Top firewall source IPs</h2><span class=\"sev info\">FortiView</span></div><div class=\"ncb\"><p class=\"traffic-note\">Click a source to filter the firewall and proxy evidence to that IP.</p><div id=\"tr-sources\"></div></div></section>\n    <section class=\"ncard c6\" id=\"tr-meraki-card\"><div class=\"nch\"><h2>Meraki Wi-Fi applications</h2><span class=\"sev info\">Wireless only</span></div><div class=\"ncb\"><p class=\"traffic-note\">Application labels may describe the encrypted tunnel. Values retain Meraki’s reported kb units; categories are not added together or compared as firewall bytes.</p><div id=\"tr-meraki\"></div></div></section>\n    \n    \n    <section class=\"ncard c12\" id=\"tr-switch-card\"><div class=\"nch\"><h2>Switch port comparison</h2><span class=\"sev info\">SNMP cache</span></div><div class=\"ncb\"><p class=\"traffic-note\">Port rates show in/out at each interface. Direction varies by connection, and paths must not be summed into a WAN total.</p><div id=\"tr-switches\"></div></div></section>\n  </div>\n"
}
